{"seq":2,"slug":"hallucination-mitigation","title":"幻觉缓解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/evaluation-and-safety/hallucination-mitigation","wordCount":708,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"幻觉缓解\">幻觉缓解</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>幻觉的讨论沿「定义 → 根因 → 检测 → 缓解」展开，几个核心概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>幻觉（Hallucination）</strong>：模型生成看似合理但实际不正确或无依据的内容。</li>\n<li><strong>幻觉类型</strong>：事实性幻觉（生成错误事实）、忠实性幻觉（与输入不一致）、编造幻觉（无中生有），以及逻辑矛盾与过度自信。</li>\n<li><strong>根因三层</strong>：训练数据（含错、过时、长尾样本不足）、训练目标（优化 token 概率而非事实准确性）、解码过程（自回归误差累积）。</li>\n<li><strong>检测手段</strong>：基于 NLI 的蕴含检查、基于检索的外部验证、自我一致性、不确定性估计与引用验证。</li>\n<li><strong>缓解手段</strong>：RAG 提供知识锚点、引用标注增加可追溯性、置信度校准识别不确定区域、事实核查与自我反思。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条主线是**「幻觉无法完全消除，只能控制」**：因此工程上的正确答案不是追求单一银弹，而是把多种策略组合成一道纵深防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是幻觉\">什么是幻觉</h2><p>幻觉（Hallucination）是 LLM 生成看似合理但实际不正确或无依据内容的现象。这是当前 LLM 面临的最大可靠性挑战之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 幻觉类型&#10;        F[&quot;事实性幻觉&lt;br/&gt;生成错误事实&quot;]&#10;        I[&quot;忠实性幻觉&lt;br/&gt;与输入不一致&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;编造幻觉&lt;br/&gt;无中生有&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    F --&gt; E1[&quot;说 Python 发布于 1985 年&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; E2[&quot;摘要中添加原文没有的信息&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E3[&quot;引用不存在的论文&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 幻觉类型\n        F[\"事实性幻觉&lt;br/&gt;生成错误事实\"]\n        I[\"忠实性幻觉&lt;br/&gt;与输入不一致\"]\n        C[\"编造幻觉&lt;br/&gt;无中生有\"]\n    end\n    F --&gt; E1[\"说 Python 发布于 1985 年\"]\n    I --&gt; E2[\"摘要中添加原文没有的信息\"]\n    C --&gt; E3[\"引用不存在的论文\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>幻觉类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实错误</td>\n<td>声称不正确的事实</td>\n<td>&quot;地球到太阳距离 1 亿公里&quot;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编造引用</td>\n<td>引用不存在的来源</td>\n<td>&quot;根据 Smith (2023) 的研究...&quot;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑矛盾</td>\n<td>前后不一致</td>\n<td>&quot;A 大于 B...所以 B 更大&quot;</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度自信</td>\n<td>对不确定信息断言</td>\n<td>&quot;毫无疑问地...&quot;</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"幻觉的根因\">幻觉的根因</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Root[&quot;幻觉根因&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;训练数据&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; M[&quot;模型架构&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; T[&quot;训练目标&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; I[&quot;推理过程&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;数据中包含错误信息&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;训练数据截止导致知识过时&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; M1[&quot;模型无法区分记忆和推理&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; T1[&quot;优化流畅度而非准确性&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; I1[&quot;自回归生成的错误累积&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    Root[\"幻觉根因\"] --&gt; D[\"训练数据\"]\n    Root --&gt; M[\"模型架构\"]\n    Root --&gt; T[\"训练目标\"]\n    Root --&gt; I[\"推理过程\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"数据中包含错误信息\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"训练数据截止导致知识过时\"]\n    M --&gt; M1[\"模型无法区分记忆和推理\"]\n    T --&gt; T1[\"优化流畅度而非准确性\"]\n    I --&gt; I1[\"自回归生成的错误累积\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"hallucination_causes = {&#10;    &quot;训练数据问题&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;互联网数据包含大量不准确信息&quot;,&#10;        &quot;数据截止日期后的事件无法正确回答&quot;,&#10;        &quot;长尾知识在训练数据中样本不足&quot;,&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;训练目标偏差&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;交叉熵损失优化的是 token 级概率，非事实准确性&quot;,&#10;        &quot;RLHF 可能强化「自信地回答」而非「准确地回答」&quot;,&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;解码过程问题&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;自回归生成中早期错误会传播和放大&quot;,&#10;        &quot;采样温度过高增加随机性&quot;,&#10;    ],&#10;}&#10;&#10;for cause, details in hallucination_causes.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;原因: {cause}&quot;)&#10;    for d in details:&#10;        print(f&quot;  - {d}&quot;)&#10;    print()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hallucination_causes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"训练数据问题\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"互联网数据包含大量不准确信息\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"数据截止日期后的事件无法正确回答\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"长尾知识在训练数据中样本不足\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"训练目标偏差\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"交叉熵损失优化的是 token 级概率，非事实准确性\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"RLHF 可能强化「自信地回答」而非「准确地回答」\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"解码过程问题\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"自回归生成中早期错误会传播和放大\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"采样温度过高增加随机性\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cause, details </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hallucination_causes.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原因: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cause</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> details:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  - </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"检测方法\">检测方法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class HallucinationDetector:&#10;    def __init__(self, fact_checker, nli_model):&#10;        self.fact_checker = fact_checker&#10;        self.nli_model = nli_model&#10;&#10;    def check_factuality(self, claim):&#10;        evidence = self.fact_checker.search(claim)&#10;        result = self.nli_model.predict(evidence, claim)&#10;        return result&#10;&#10;    def check_consistency(self, source, generated):&#10;        sentences = generated.split(&quot;。&quot;)&#10;        inconsistent = []&#10;        for sent in sentences:&#10;            if sent.strip():&#10;                label = self.nli_model.predict(source, sent)&#10;                if label == &quot;contradiction&quot;:&#10;                    inconsistent.append(sent)&#10;        return inconsistent&#10;&#10;detection_methods = {&#10;    &quot;基于 NLI&quot;: &quot;用自然语言推理模型检查文本蕴含关系&quot;,&#10;    &quot;基于检索&quot;: &quot;检索外部知识验证生成内容&quot;,&#10;    &quot;自我一致性&quot;: &quot;多次生成，检查答案一致性&quot;,&#10;    &quot;不确定性估计&quot;: &quot;通过 token 概率评估模型确信度&quot;,&#10;    &quot;引用验证&quot;: &quot;检查引用的来源是否真实存在&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;print(&quot;幻觉检测方法:&quot;)&#10;for method, desc in detection_methods.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;  {method}: {desc}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HallucinationDetector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, fact_checker, nli_model):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fact_checker </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fact_checker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nli_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nli_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_factuality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, claim):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        evidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fact_checker.search(claim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nli_model.predict(evidence, claim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_consistency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, source, generated):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sentences </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generated.split(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        inconsistent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sentences:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sent.strip():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                label </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nli_model.predict(source, sent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"contradiction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    inconsistent.append(sent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inconsistent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">detection_methods </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"基于 NLI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"用自然语言推理模型检查文本蕴含关系\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"基于检索\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"检索外部知识验证生成内容\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"自我一致性\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"多次生成，检查答案一致性\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"不确定性估计\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"通过 token 概率评估模型确信度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"引用验证\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"检查引用的来源是否真实存在\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"幻觉检测方法:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> method, desc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detection_methods.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">method</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓解策略\">缓解策略</h2><h3 id=\"检索增强-rag\">检索增强（RAG）</h3><p>RAG 是缓解幻觉最有效的技术手段，通过提供外部知识来&quot;锚定&quot;模型输出：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Q[&quot;问题&quot;] --&gt; R[&quot;检索相关文档&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; D[&quot;参考文档&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; P[&quot;Prompt: 基于文档回答&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; P&#10;    P --&gt; LLM[&quot;LLM&quot;]&#10;    LLM --&gt; A[&quot;有据可查的回答&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Q[\"问题\"] --&gt; R[\"检索相关文档\"]\n    R --&gt; D[\"参考文档\"]\n    D --&gt; P[\"Prompt: 基于文档回答\"]\n    Q --&gt; P\n    P --&gt; LLM[\"LLM\"]\n    LLM --&gt; A[\"有据可查的回答\"]</pre><h3 id=\"引用标注\">引用标注</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"citation_prompt = &quot;&quot;&quot;基于以下参考文档回答问题。回答中必须标注引用来源。&#10;&#10;参考文档：&#10;[1] LoRA 通过低秩分解减少微调参数量，通常只需原模型 0.1-1% 的参数。&#10;[2] QLoRA 在 4-bit 量化模型上应用 LoRA，7B 模型只需 6GB 显存即可微调。&#10;[3] 全量微调更新所有参数，7B 模型需要约 100GB 显存。&#10;&#10;问题：微调 7B 模型需要多少显存？&#10;&#10;回答格式：&#10;回答内容 [引用编号]&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;print(citation_prompt)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">citation_prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"基于以下参考文档回答问题。回答中必须标注引用来源。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">参考文档：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[1] LoRA 通过低秩分解减少微调参数量，通常只需原模型 0.1-1% 的参数。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[2] QLoRA 在 4-bit 量化模型上应用 LoRA，7B 模型只需 6GB 显存即可微调。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[3] 全量微调更新所有参数，7B 模型需要约 100GB 显存。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">问题：微调 7B 模型需要多少显存？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">回答格式：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">回答内容 [引用编号]\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(citation_prompt)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"置信度校准\">置信度校准</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def assess_confidence(logprobs, threshold=0.7):&#10;    avg_prob = sum(logprobs) / len(logprobs)&#10;    min_prob = min(logprobs)&#10;&#10;    if avg_prob &gt; threshold and min_prob &gt; 0.5:&#10;        return &quot;高置信度&quot;, avg_prob&#10;    elif avg_prob &gt; 0.4:&#10;        return &quot;中等置信度 - 建议验证&quot;, avg_prob&#10;    else:&#10;        return &quot;低置信度 - 可能包含幻觉&quot;, avg_prob&#10;&#10;simulated_probs = [0.95, 0.88, 0.72, 0.91, 0.85]&#10;level, score = assess_confidence(simulated_probs)&#10;print(f&quot;置信度评估: {level} (平均概率: {score:.2f})&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assess_confidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logprobs, threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    avg_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logprobs) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logprobs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    min_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logprobs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"高置信度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, avg_prob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"中等置信度 - 建议验证\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, avg_prob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"低置信度 - 可能包含幻觉\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, avg_prob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">simulated_probs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.91</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">level, score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assess_confidence(simulated_probs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"置信度评估: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">level</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> (平均概率: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓解策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>实施复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RAG</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用标注</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>置信度校准</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自我反思</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（多次调用）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事实核查</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 最有效的幻觉缓解通常是多种策略的组合：RAG 提供知识锚点 + 引用标注增加可追溯性 + 置信度校准识别不确定区域。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>幻觉是 LLM 生成不准确内容的现象，分为事实错误、编造引用和逻辑矛盾等类型。</li>\n<li>根本原因包括训练数据噪声、优化目标偏差和自回归误差累积。</li>\n<li>RAG 是最有效的幻觉缓解手段，通过外部知识&quot;锚定&quot;模型输出。</li>\n<li>引用标注和置信度校准提供了输出可靠性的量化信号。</li>\n<li>幻觉无法完全消除，但通过多策略组合可以将其控制在可接受范围内。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"幻觉缓解","id":"幻觉缓解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是幻觉","id":"什么是幻觉"},{"level":2,"text":"幻觉的根因","id":"幻觉的根因"},{"level":2,"text":"检测方法","id":"检测方法"},{"level":2,"text":"缓解策略","id":"缓解策略"},{"level":3,"text":"检索增强（RAG）","id":"检索增强-rag"},{"level":3,"text":"引用标注","id":"引用标注"},{"level":3,"text":"置信度校准","id":"置信度校准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基准测试与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/evaluation-and-safety/benchmark-and-evaluation"},"next":{"title":"安全与护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/evaluation-and-safety/safety-and-guardrails"}}